+ * units reach wifi.h BEFORE that header, so the struct was skipped while its USE in
+ * 8192cd.h (guarded by the same macro, but reached after the config) still compiled —
+ * giving "field 'amsdullcsnaphdr' has incomplete type". Pull the config in first so the
+ * guards agree no matter the include order. */
