+ * that macro — so the type is used but never defined, and every translation unit that
+ * does not otherwise pull in the `#else` branch fails with
+ * "field 'amsdullcsnaphdr' has incomplete type" (the phydm/ units).
+ * Defining it here as well makes both branches agree. */
